Source docs/tapes/settings.tape
Hide
Type `cd "$DEMO_REPO" && clear && BTB_CONFIG="$DEMO_BTB_ER" nvim --cmd "luafile $DEMO_LUA" lua/init.lua`
Enter
Sleep 4s
Show
Sleep 1s
Type " kk"
Sleep 4s
Enter
Sleep 5s
Screenshot images/demo/btb_coach.png
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
Enter
Sleep 7s
Screenshot images/demo/btb_exercise.png
Sleep 1s
